==English==

===Noun===
'''[[take]] [[out]]'''

# Alternative spelling of [[takeout]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=to [[take]] [[out]]|takes out|taking out|took out|taken out}}

# To [[remove]].
#: ''Please '''take out''' the trash before the whole house starts to smell''
# To [[escort]] someone on a [[date]].
#: ''Let me '''take you out''' for dinner''
# {{idiom}} To [[immobilize]] with [[force]].
# {{slang|idiom}} To [[kill]] or [[destroy]].

